/*                                                             */
/* Benefits of EXPORT(*BNDFILE) over EXPORT(*ALL):            */
/*   - Only declared symbols are visible to callers            */
/*   - Signature is stable; adding private procedures         */
/*     does NOT change the service program signature           */
/*   - Re-binding is required only when exports change         */
/* ============================================================ */

